        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/839c29/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-05-27T23:55:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would say it helped me a bit. I started right before the rook city infernal relics expansion came out and probably got everything in the game at once. Allows me to go through a bit slower to learn the decks. So for the most villains I had only played them once or twice. Now with the app I have probably played each villian and hero at least 30 times. I got a couple other people who want the app but not till multiplayer is here.&nbsp;</p>",
