        "username": "MarioFanaticXV",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mariofanaticxv/{size}/2129_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-06-01T11:31:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've definitely been a lot more open to playing random or with heroes that I didn't think would work well together than I was with the phsyical version; this is largely due to the reduced setup and take down time. I can usually play the digital version in about twenty minutes- a long game once took about forty. With the physical version? I usually take an hour in all, with some games taking twice that long. When a game is much shorter but still has the same content? I'm much more willing to try a match that has the odds stacked against me.</p>",
